{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "7d446eaf2b74791667f4dc131f4bac246392d40b0b4e647069bd04bc687482bf", "ja": "着こなしもそっくりだったんだよね……。\nセンスも体格も似てるってことになるから……。", "zh": "连穿衣风格都一模一样呢……\n也就是说，品味和身材都很相似……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "52876a93364a023919040120ee4f339b18d8c7617c2a55bca4ac608e58c4774e", "ja": "他にどういうお洋服を揃えてるのか……\n純粋に知りたかった……！", "zh": "我只是单纯想知道……\n你还准备了什么样的衣服……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "581ecf2f0bc29147d0ed5fb10ad356a5a526e075070271a8b34be0ff44126a3f", "ja": "でも、それきっかけで話しかけるのは\nさすがに勇気出ないな～……。", "zh": "不过，要以此为契机主动搭话，实在是鼓不起勇气啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1003_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9fb3cc14420227110d113c06fca638679bb4177e69d809b1aa87091fe9067837", "ja": "お疲れさまです。あの、\n青羽さん……？　ですよね……？", "zh": "辛苦了。那个，\n您是青羽小姐……对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "cf1fabef2e0abcd6203a85a328e2d6b2b0d14576113baeed511e17118012ce1a", "ja": "？　はい、青羽美咲です。どうしたんですか？\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "？是的，我是青羽美咲。怎么了吗？{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "82a9103e767bf87e068c977984fd368eadf080856b489f14799e1cdf0730d6ec", "ja": "いえ……今日通勤してくる途中、\n青羽さんに背格好が似てる人を見かけて……。", "zh": "没……只是今天上班途中，\n看到了一个体型长相和青羽小姐很像的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "ed2cf0505221bd60659ccf524496068020b259ceca129fab93d00ac9b19d4730", "ja": "えっ！？\nそ、それって……！", "zh": "咦！？\n那、那个人是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cd989fded5d758fd551da17064ba281f967e3a22af7d117069a5bebca20973eb", "ja": "服装も、見た覚えがあるものだったので。でも\n本当に青羽さんか自信が持てなくて……。", "zh": "因为那身打扮，我也觉得有些眼熟。但又没把握确定真的是青羽小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "380d2e0d188ff02d2c508caabcec2a8b5fa3d7961096d0fc785d4f1727acab5e", "ja": "うっかり、じっと見てしまってたみたいなんです。\nそれで、駅員さんに呼ばれて……。", "zh": "我不小心一直盯着看了。\n结果就被车站工作人员叫住了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "701e594fc421a161c4cb98f0e6543a9c7ee723ced8effb0be69465fd4acde6b1", "ja": "ええっ！？　そうだったんですか……。", "zh": "诶！？原来是这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a133f65de8eb954c4b35c4d237b2ecd5834bf0daa8bb214e3a84c25cb7bc5157", "ja": "でもよく考えたら、ジロジロ人を眺めるなんて、\n失礼なことですよね。猛省しないと……。", "zh": "不过仔细想想，这样盯着别人看，确实很失礼。得好好反省才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "6e6249772359c5b57b072c50d140dfd01d08c84f81e741a35920ccfff43ab160", "ja": "はっ！　ジロジロ人を眺める……そうですよね……。\nあのっ、私も気をつけます！", "zh": "啊！盯着别人看……确实是很失礼的行为呢……。那个，我也会注意的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4ec39f7cfe94742eff50f2e04dc1081cdbf16e58e0edbddf99900ae102dfb4b3", "ja": "？　あ、そうだ。社長から呼ばれているので、\n自分は今から事務所に向かいますね。", "zh": "？啊，对了。社长叫我过去，所以我现在要去一趟事务所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "e19830dc69a9d2853f435168677a614fe1ea359cb2d528835639a743b1068044", "ja": "はい、いってらっしゃ～い！　……危ない、\n不審者になるところだった……！", "zh": "好，路上小心～！……糟糕，差点就要变成可疑人士了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1015_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "6acae3a28c5c681eaf7818cdd10d8e9bbc20cb29bcc3f2d1b313fb455ab0d129", "ja": "劇場のアイドル39人が役を引き継ぎながら、\n全員で作り上げていく舞台……。", "zh": "由剧场的偶像39人接力出演、共同打造的舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "09f9e9f11c4e542052271383cd96e9d91a50aaa648adf26d5261117e52eeab44", "ja": "『STARDOM ROAD』も、第六幕に突入だ。\n今回の狙い、私も悪くないと思えたよ。", "zh": "『STARDOM ROAD』也进入了第六幕。\n这次的目标，我也觉得挺不错的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b3b8ffdb43a18592957b875aefaf2ed9a32141a0ae9237413f000d5d227cd915", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　今回は暁クロエを主演に\n据えて、彼女にスポットを当てるつもりです。", "zh": "谢谢！这次打算让晓克洛伊担任主演，把焦点放在她身上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "30115e24680eb8f3f80ec020a7bf7fb16d33988b3691e7927a4244a9ad3b67c9", "ja": "前回は、三船なるちゃんが主演でしたもんね。\n友情と恋心、お仕事に揺れる心が描かれて……。", "zh": "上次是三船なる主演的，对吧。描写了在友情、恋心和工作之间摇摆的内心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "3ff332d592168f5c884872d2b19daa3fb86c9eff7b4b70dce55329ee892819cf", "ja": "あれもとっても素敵なお話でしたけど、\n今回はクロエちゃん……き、気になります！", "zh": "那也是个非常棒的故事呢，\n不过这次是克洛伊……我、我好在意啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7218fdb59a73a23f9637281c75f3a78d8b1aa2e4db3922e95ad2a6529a4b8d2e", "ja": "はい。クロエは途中から加入したのもあり、\n掴みにくいキャラではあると思うんですが……。", "zh": "是的。克洛伊也是中途加入的角色，所以我觉得她可能是个不太容易让人摸清的角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b9b1122cdb24caf1a505b33b5eaafe47b7058ff7cca803f2bb26bde1cd729b70", "ja": "強い個性と独自の魅力の持ち主です。\n今回演じるアイドルともシナジーがあるはず。", "zh": "她拥有强烈的个性与独一无二的魅力。\n和这次饰演她的偶像应该也会产生协同效应。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "09b6940dd934677043bbb3679070402cd5e23f08e6bee7447fc708ab8a8850aa", "ja": "融合した二人の魅力を、\n観客にしっかり届けられたらと思います！", "zh": "希望能把两人融合在一起的魅力，好好地传递给观众！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "badb4c6950175efbc9cb9b82569eb2ddf8c74a1d8078540b92f5958a4df91caf", "ja": "今回クロエちゃんを演じるのは……ふふっ♪\n確かに、すごい化学反応が起きる予感です！", "zh": "这次饰演克洛伊的是……呵呵♪\n确实，让人感觉会产生奇妙的化学反应呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "440d1bc43cdf834980325b215003e42de1687428241786a56fe04cfeb2e0f9c7", "ja": "第六幕も期待できそうだね。\nぜひ君のプランで進めようじゃないか！", "zh": "第六幕似乎也值得期待。就按你的方案推进吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "97bcb546bf87e46162c84f574d1e9441b66c7586978bdde840f4e99d82523379", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nアイドルが輝く舞台、全力で臨みます！", "zh": "谢谢！\n我会全力以赴，为偶像们打造闪耀的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
